    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495300/extras/e8a8c59c4ecb50b69ab0f4e8215cb4a5.avif?t=1739917675\" width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the challenge</strong> and prove your skill! <i>Beetlemen</i> demands perfect precision with every move, where only the most skilled reach the top. With each attempt, you sharpen your technique and go further. Overcome the obstacles, surpass your limits... And don\u2019t stop until you touch the sky! The leap to victory begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you start the game, the environment is slightly different from the previous one; the platforms will never be the same in two consecutive playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features mechanics like Dash and double jump, which can be upgraded as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to finish in a single run, so there are no saves \u2014 only the highest reached height is saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495300/extras/1dd7b739e354d1cf4dbc2cfb6c855e83.poster.avif?t=1739917675\" width=426 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495300/extras/1dd7b739e354d1cf4dbc2cfb6c855e83.webm?t=1739917675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495300/extras/1dd7b739e354d1cf4dbc2cfb6c855e83.mp4?t=1739917675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495300/extras/e8a8c59c4ecb50b69ab0f4e8215cb4a5.avif?t=1739917675\" width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the challenge</strong> and prove your skill! <i>Beetlemen</i> demands perfect precision with every move, where only the most skilled reach the top. With each attempt, you sharpen your technique and go further. Overcome the obstacles, surpass your limits... And don\u2019t stop until you touch the sky! The leap to victory begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you start the game, the environment is slightly different from the previous one; the platforms will never be the same in two consecutive playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features mechanics like Dash and double jump, which can be upgraded as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to finish in a single run, so there are no saves \u2014 only the highest reached height is saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495300/extras/1dd7b739e354d1cf4dbc2cfb6c855e83.poster.avif?t=1739917675\" width=426 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495300/extras/1dd7b739e354d1cf4dbc2cfb6c855e83.webm?t=1739917675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495300/extras/1dd7b739e354d1cf4dbc2cfb6c855e83.mp4?t=1739917675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
